        summary: "{D} was laid off on a Wednesday. On {DATE}, {D}'s old login downloaded a client pricing spreadsheet from the company drive. The sign-in came from a coffee shop Wi-Fi. {DL} says {D.he} was exporting personal files from {D.his} own profile.",
