        defendant: [.direct("Describe your life before that day for the jury.", "\"I live alone and I have been treated for confusion for years. I take medication, and I try to keep a routine so I can function.\""), .direct("What happened with your medication?", "\"A pharmacy error doubled my dose two days before the fair. I felt strange and sick, and I was not myself.\""), .direct("What do you remember about the fair?", "\"Noise and lights. Nothing was clear. I remember getting into the pickup, and then I remember walking out, but not what happened between.\""), .direct("Why did you send the text at noon?", "\"I was angry at my former partner. I was feeling sick and I wrote something I did not mean, and I did not plan anything.\""), .direct("What did you mean when you told a friend everyone will remember my name?", "\"I do not remember saying it. I was confused, and I was not thinking about the fair. I hear how that sounds.\""), .direct("Looking back, how do you feel about what happened?", "\"The word for it is horror. People died and many were hurt. I do not understand how it happened, and I wish I could take it back.\""), .cross("You pressed the accelerator for eight seconds, didn't you?", "\"The data says so. I do not remember pressing it. I do not know why I did not brake.\""), .cross("You sent a threat to your former partner that noon, didn't you?", "\"Yes. I was angry. I did not mean it as a plan, but I know it sounds terrible.\""), .cross("You drove past a gate and into the crowd, didn't you?", "\"Yes. The camera shows it. I do not remember driving past the gate, and I do not know why I did not stop.\""), .cross("You walked out of the fairgrounds and did not turn yourself in, did you?", "\"I walked out because I was confused. I did not know what I had done, and I did not know where to go.\""), .cross("You sent a threat to a former partner a few hours before, didn't you?", "\"Yes. I wrote something in a rage that I did not understand. I am deeply sorry, and I know no words can undo what happened.\"")],
        openings: ("On {DATE}, hours after texting a threat to a former partner, {D} drove a pickup across a crowded county fair midway for about 200 feet. Two people died, including {V}, and thirty were hurt.", "The defense will present a mind in crisis, a medication doubled by a pharmacy error two days before, and a psychiatrist who will explain what that does. {D} was confused and sick, and the State must prove more."),
